<form method="post" action="/admin/settings"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>">
<div class="card"><h3>站点信息</h3><div class="form-grid">
<div class="form-row"><label>商城名称 *</label><input name="shop_name" value="<%= s.shop_name %>" required></div><div class="form-row"><label>Slogan</label><input name="slogan" value="<%= s.slogan %>"></div>
<div class="form-row" style="grid-column:1/-1"><label>顶部公告条(留空则不显示)</label><input name="announcement" value="<%= s.announcement %>"></div>
<div class="form-row"><label>客服电话</label><input name="service_phone" value="<%= s.service_phone %>"><div class="help">默认 400-888-6666 为演示号码,前台标「演示」</div></div><div class="form-row"><label>客服微信号</label><input name="service_wechat" value="<%= s.service_wechat || '' %>" maxlength="40"><div class="help">默认 yunnong-kefu 为演示值,前台标「演示」;留空不显示</div></div><div class="form-row"><label>客服快捷问题(每行一个,最多 6 个)</label><textarea name="service_quick_questions" rows="3" maxlength="300"><%= s.service_quick_questions || '' %></textarea><div class="help">显示在「在线客服」输入框上方,用户点击即发送并自动回答;「积分怎么用」为固定项,始终显示</div></div><div class="form-row"><label>客服时间</label><input name="service_hours" value="<%= s.service_hours %>"></div>
<div class="form-row"><label>客服邮箱</label><input name="service_email" value="<%= s.service_email %>"></div><div class="form-row"><label>备案号</label><input name="icp" value="<%= s.icp %>"></div>
<div class="form-row"><label>默认发货地(商品页「配送」)</label><input name="ship_from" value="<%= s.ship_from || '' %>" maxlength="20"><div class="help">如「海口发货」;单个商品可在商品编辑中覆盖</div></div><div class="form-row" style="grid-column:1/-1"><label>公司/发货地址</label><input name="address" value="<%= s.address %>"></div></div></div>
<div class="card"><h3>交易与会员规则</h3><div class="form-grid">
<div class="form-row" style="grid-column:1/-1"><div class="help">积分不可购买、转让或提现。邀请奖励请在「<a href="/admin/invites">邀请管理</a>」配置,云商卡权益请在「<a href="/admin/cloud-settings">云商卡配置</a>」配置。</div></div>
<div class="form-row"><label>注册奖励积分</label><input type="number" name="register_points" value="<%= s.register_points %>"></div><div class="form-row"><label>发表评价奖励积分(与评分、审核结果无关)</label><input type="number" name="review_points" value="<%= s.review_points %>"></div>
<div class="form-row"><label>每日签到基础积分</label><input type="number" name="signin_base" value="<%= s.signin_base %>"></div><div class="form-row"><label>库存预警阈值</label><input type="number" name="stock_warn" value="<%= s.stock_warn %>"></div>
<div class="form-row"><label>待付款自动取消(分钟)</label><input type="number" name="unpaid_cancel_minutes" value="<%= s.unpaid_cancel_minutes %>"></div><div class="form-row"><label>发货后自动确认收货(天)</label><input type="number" name="auto_confirm_days" value="<%= s.auto_confirm_days %>"></div>
<div class="form-row"><label>售后申请有效期(天)</label><input type="number" name="aftersale_days" value="<%= s.aftersale_days %>"></div><div class="form-row"><label>「热卖」标签销量阈值(件)</label><input type="number" min="0" name="hot_sales_threshold" value="<%= s.hot_sales_threshold %>"><div class="help">真实销量达到该值才显示「热卖」;0 表示不显示</div></div><div class="form-row"><label>「新品」标签天数</label><input type="number" min="0" name="new_days" value="<%= s.new_days %>"><div class="help">上架 N 天内显示「新品」;0 表示不显示</div></div><div class="form-row"><label>前台显示销量</label><label style="font-weight:400"><input type="checkbox" name="show_sales" value="1" <%= s.show_sales==='1'?'checked':'' %>> 前台显示销量</label><div class="help">默认关闭。开启后仅显示按真实订单计算的销量(已支付/发货/完成,扣除退款),销量为 0 时不显示</div></div></div></div>
<button class="btn primary" style="padding:9px 30px">保存设置</button></form>
<form method="post" action="/admin/settings/points" enctype="multipart/form-data" id="points" class="mt"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>">
<div class="card"><h3>积分设置</h3><div class="form-grid">
<div class="form-row"><label>积分有效期</label><label style="font-weight:400"><input type="checkbox" name="points_expiry_enable" value="1" <%= s.points_expiry_enable==='1'?'checked':'' %>> 启用周期清零</label><div class="help">清零日起算一个周期;某周期内获得的积分于再下一个清零日前一天 24:00 过期(默认 06-01:2026-06-01~2027-05-31 获得的积分于 2028-05-31 24:00 过期)</div></div>
<div class="form-row"><label>清零日(MM-DD)</label><input name="points_clear_day" value="<%= s.points_clear_day %>" pattern="\d{2}-\d{2}" placeholder="06-01"></div>
<div class="form-row"><label>到期前提醒(天)</label><input type="number" name="points_expiry_remind_days" min="1" max="180" value="<%= s.points_expiry_remind_days %>"><div class="help">到期前 N 天发送站内消息提醒(微信订阅消息待接入)</div></div>
<div class="form-row" style="grid-column:1/-1"><label>积分兑换须知(兑换确认页小字;留空则不显示)</label><textarea name="points_redeem_notice" rows="2" maxlength="200"><%= s.points_redeem_notice %></textarea></div>
<div class="form-row"><label>下单积分抵现</label><label style="font-weight:400"><input type="checkbox" name="points_deduct_enable" value="1" <%= s.points_deduct_enable==='1'?'checked':'' %>> 启用(默认关闭)</label><div class="help">关闭时前台不展示任何积分折现比例,结算页无积分抵扣</div></div>
<div class="form-row"><label>积分抵现比例(多少积分抵 ¥1)</label><input type="number" name="points_rate" min="1" value="<%= s.points_rate %>"></div><div class="form-row"><label>积分最高抵扣订单百分比(%)</label><input type="number" name="points_max_percent" min="0" max="100" value="<%= s.points_max_percent %>"></div>
</div></div><button class="btn primary" style="padding:9px 30px">保存积分设置</button></form>
